  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://windsorfilmfestival.com/film/ST00003784/",
          "overview": "Refusing to go to school, anxious 16-year-old Tori is driven by her mother to her grandfather's rustic cabin in Eastern Manitoba on the remote American-Canadian border. As Tori struggles to adapt to the woodsman ways of her French Canadian grandfather, she ultimately must embrace the outdoors if she is to survive the deadly game of cat and mouse she is thrust into.",
          "runtime": 92,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CA",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Témoin d'un meurtre, une adolescente angoissée doit survivre dans la nature canadienne en hiver et venir à bout de redoutables adversaires.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "La peau de l'ours"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Recusando-se a ir para a escola, a ansiosa Tori, de 16 anos, é levada por sua mãe para a cabana rústica de seu avô no leste de Manitoba, na remota fronteira entre os Estados Unidos e o Canadá. Enquanto Tori luta para se adaptar aos costumes de lenhador de seu avô franco-canadense, ela acaba tendo que abraçar a natureza se quiser sobreviver ao jogo mortal de gato e rato em que é lançada.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "A cause des réseaux sociaux, Tori a développé de l'anxiété. Lorsqu'elle refuse d'aller à l'école, sa mère inquiète l'envoie chez son grand-père Benoit dans une cabane en pleine nature pour apprendre les techniques de survie.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "熊毛"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "NL",
        "iso_639_1": "nl",
        "name": "Nederlands",
        "english_name": "Dutch",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "De angstige zestienjarige Tori weigert naar school te gaan en wordt door haar moeder naar de rustieke blokhut van haar grootvader in Oost-Manitoba, aan de afgelegen grens tussen Amerika en Canada, gebracht. Terwijl Tori worstelt om zich aan te passen aan de levensstijl van haar Frans-Canadese grootvader, moet ze uiteindelijk de natuur omarmen om te overleven in het dodelijke kat-en-muisspel waarin ze terechtkomt.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      }
    ]
